WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:20.390
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and the first
trailer for guardians of the galaxy just dropped

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.109
so I wanted to do a larger preview for the
movie with backgrounds on what marvel is doing

00:00:24.109 --> 00:00:27.770
with the characters that’s different from
the comic books as well as breaking down what’s

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:30.150
been happening with their story up to this
point.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.329
They really just rebooted the comic last year
and it’s totally awesome.

00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:37.680
I’ll probably start doing marvel movie videos
every tuesday since so much is happening.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.140
Be sure to subscribe to get everything if
you’re just finding me for the first time.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.140
So let’s start with the characters.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:44.260
We’ve got all the original guardians team
from the comics sans Tony Stark.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:49.060
That’s right Iron Man traveled with them
in the comics last year.

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:54.590
But it’s Peter Quill slash Starr Lord, Gamora,
Drax The Destroyer, Groot and Rocket Raccoon.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:58.079
They changed the makeup and the outfits just
a little from the comics just for practical

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:01.670
reasons, rocket raccoon is pretty close to
his comic book model.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:04.949
Groot is the biggest change, he’s just made
to look a little more humanoid in the movie.

00:01:04.949 --> 00:01:05.949
His comic book version is a little more tree-like.

00:01:05.949 --> 00:01:08.530
The important thing to know is that they won’t
be a team at the beginning of the movie, it’s

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.720
all about them coming together over the course
of the movie.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.510
The other heroes that aren’t part of the
guardian’s team include Yondu, Nova, Rhomann

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:19.020
Dey and Nova Prime, she’s the leader of
the nova corps.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.670
Like the nick fury of Nova.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:30.540
Now the villains, up at the top there’s
The collector, Ronan The Accuser, Nebula and

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.540
Korath.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.450
There are a bunch of actors listed in un-named
or secret roles.

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:36.260
The most important is Sean Gunn.

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:38.479
He’s the brother of director James Gunn.

00:01:38.479 --> 00:01:41.939
At comic con he said he’d have a really
important part in the movie, but wouldn’t

00:01:41.939 --> 00:01:43.030
say what it was.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:49.340
So he could just have been joking and he’ll
turn out to be a janitor or something.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.619
But one of the biggest un-named roles is Thanos.

00:01:53.619 --> 00:01:57.080
Because he’s such a part of the Guardian’s
stories in the comic books he will be a part

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.080
of the movie, but in reference only.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.640
He’s not going to be a character.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:03.100
It’s possible that he’ll be involved in
the post credits scene if it’s not Ant-Man

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.100
related.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.200
The writers have said that he’s a galactic
presence in the movie, so he exists and people

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.229
know about him, but he’s not a huge part
of the plot.

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.810
The collector and ronan the accuser are the
main antagonists.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:16.060
If you’re not familiar with the characters
or you haven’t read the comics in a while,

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.360
here’s a quick breakdown of the major characters.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.680
Peter Quill aka Starr Lord is the son of a
human woman and the emperor of the spartoi

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:23.680
empire.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:26.239
Also humanoid, that’s why he looks like
a normal person.

00:02:26.239 --> 00:02:29.739
The character first debuted in the comics
in 1976.

00:02:29.739 --> 00:02:33.440
Some of the character traits we’ll see in
the movie is his deadpool-level wisecracking

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:37.769
abilities and resevoir of 80s pop culture
references.

00:02:37.769 --> 00:02:41.980
He’s a good analog for a smarter version
of Han Solo.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:45.180
If han solo were the prince of an entire galaxy.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:50.109
He’s the main protagonist of the film and
he’ll be the one to slowly round up the

00:02:50.109 --> 00:02:51.110
Guardians and make them a team.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.639
Then there’s Gamora.

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:56.519
You absolutely have to read the current comic
book run, because she is hilarious in it.

00:02:56.519 --> 00:03:00.199
Not because she tells jokes, she’s always
the serious person that everyone reacts to

00:03:00.199 --> 00:03:02.590
when she does something hardcore.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:06.859
She and Tony Stark have this really funny
sexual encounter too.

00:03:06.859 --> 00:03:11.269
In the movie Zoe Saldana is sporting red hair,
which is a little different from the original

00:03:11.269 --> 00:03:14.980
character, but she and Drax both have green
skin so the color change just makes them look

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.359
a little better.

00:03:16.359 --> 00:03:18.949
Notice that the color red is a big theme too.

00:03:18.949 --> 00:03:22.569
From Peter Quill’s jacket, to drax’s tattoos,
to gamora’s hair.

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:29.559
I love the way this movie looks visually.

00:03:29.559 --> 00:03:33.700
Originally in the comics she’s the last
surviving member of her race and is taken

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.499
in by Thanos and turned into a weapon of mass
destruction.

00:03:36.499 --> 00:03:39.609
So part of her story in the movie will be
Peter Quill convincing her to cut ties with

00:03:39.609 --> 00:03:41.219
Thanos and join the good side.

00:03:41.219 --> 00:03:45.129
She isn’t any less hardcore, she just starts
killing bad guys instead of good guys.

00:03:45.129 --> 00:03:49.849
I can’t wait to see Zoe Saldana go berserk
with giant weapons.

00:03:49.849 --> 00:03:52.029
Green never looked so good.

00:03:52.029 --> 00:03:56.430
Drax the Destroyer looks like Gamora, but
he’s actually a human who’s consciousness

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:00.139
was transplanted into a new body by Kronos.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:03.200
He was created by Kronos as a weapon to use
against Thanos.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.309
It’s unknown if Kronos is in the movie,
but when we first meet Drax, he’s on a prison

00:04:07.309 --> 00:04:09.680
ship and Peter Quill has to bust him out.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:13.029
The character in the comic books got retconned
a lot over the years, so they’ll probably

00:04:13.029 --> 00:04:16.421
be sticking with the most recent version of
his history from the comics.

00:04:16.421 --> 00:04:19.540
I’m really interested to see how they handle
the more supernatural magical qualities of

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:20.799
the character in the movie.

00:04:20.799 --> 00:04:24.460
Or if they just wash over all that and make
him smashy like the hulk.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.580
Groot and Rocket Raccoon are kind of a pair.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:30.370
But Groot is also the only surviving member
of his race.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.060
He can absorb wood to regenerate himself and
if he’s ever destroyed he can regrow himself

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.740
from a single splinter.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:41.330
In the comics he gets blown up a lot and rocket
raccoon always sticks one of his twigs in

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.370
a pot of water.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:47.020
He only speaks the words ‘i am groot’,
but that’s just what human ears pick up,

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.650
he does have a real language, but only rocket
raccoon can understand him.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:54.050
Just like Han Solo is the only non-droid on
the millenium falcon that can understand what

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.889
Chewy is saying.

00:04:55.889 --> 00:04:57.659
In keeping with the guardians motif, he’s
also a unique creature that was created in

00:04:57.659 --> 00:04:58.659
a lab.

00:04:58.659 --> 00:05:00.330
Pretty much all of the guardians except for
peter quill are the last surviving members

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:01.330
of their races.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.280
He was originally a regular animal that was
given human level intelligence and bipedal

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.280
movement.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.919
So that’s why he walks on two legs and uses
guns.

00:05:07.919 --> 00:05:10.840
On to the villains, the collector is actually
like a celestial being who was born right

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.050
after the big bang.

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.380
So he’s ancient.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:19.490
In the movie, Benicio Del Toro described him
as being like a space Liberace, which just

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:20.490
makes me laugh.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:23.990
I think they’ll tone down his powers just
to make him more realistic.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:27.750
But he collects artifacts like you see in
Odin’s vault in Thor.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:32.069
At the end of Thor The Dark World the warriors
three give him one of the infinity gems and

00:05:32.069 --> 00:05:34.310
he says one down five to go.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:38.270
So it’s really the collector and not Thanos
that will eventually assemble all five gems

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.340
to form the infinity gauntlet.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:40.340
So it’s possible that in the movie the collector
will actually be working for thanos or working

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.340
with him.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.690
I can’t wait to see all the easter eggs
on his ship.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:46.750
If you remember the original thor movie, Odin
actually has the gauntlet but not all the

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:47.750
gems.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.939
I don’t think Marvel is intending for the
infinity gauntlet to be reformed by thanos

00:05:50.939 --> 00:05:53.599
until Avengers 3 which isn’t coming until
2019.

00:05:53.599 --> 00:05:56.610
Ronan the accuser is the other huge villain.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.590
He’s the leader of the Kree Army.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:03.620
He has a special legion called accusers, thus
ronan the accuser.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:07.009
They’re like a slightly more sinister version
of the nova corps.

00:06:07.009 --> 00:06:11.400
The Kree Empire will be one of the big antagonists
in general for the nova corps in the movie.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:16.090
Because ronan is in the movie and the kree
empire, I’m really curious to see if we’ll

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.130
see the supreme intelligence.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:24.719
They haven’t officially announced it, so
it’s still just a theory.

00:06:24.719 --> 00:06:28.850
Nebula is another person on Thanos’ team
in the comics, in the movie she’ll be working

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:33.400
with Ronan the accuser and she’ll have an
interesting backstory relationship with Gamora.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:36.969
Since technically they both work for thanos.

00:06:36.969 --> 00:06:39.930
Unlike Gamora though, Nebula will be evil
through and through for the duration of the

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.780
movie, where Gamora will eventually join the
Guardians.

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:46.370
The other major villain is Korath.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:49.560
In the comics he’s a scientist working with
Thanos, Ronan and the Kree Empire to develop

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.120
cybernetic soldiers.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.530
In the movie I’m just expecting him to be
developing really sinister technology that

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.039
Ronan will use against the nova corps and
the guardians.

00:06:57.039 --> 00:06:59.820
There’s still a ton of other stuff we can
talk about with the movie, but let me know

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:04.409
what you’re looking forward to most and
what your big questions are.

00:07:04.409 --> 00:07:08.069
Since we’re so close to Winter Soldier I’ll
try to start doing Marvel Movie videos every

00:07:08.069 --> 00:07:09.870
tuesday now just because I’m usually already
making SHIELD videos.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.139
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:07:11.139 --> 00:07:15.370
I’ll be posting my review of the full trailer
later tonight.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:21.949
you can click here to watch it and you can
click here for my winter soldier trailer review.

00:07:21.949 --> 00:07:24.490
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:25.219
High Fives!

